    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Station Noctis is a game where you arrive safely to the final station, Noctis Station.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You can find a damaged map in the waiting room of the station and get a hint.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>If the train doesn't go in the direction you want, use the next train.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Get rid of the bomb-bearing mannequins lurking in the station and get to Noctis Station safely!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Station Noctis is a puzzle game with a horror atmosphere.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>If you look closely at the map, you'll see where to go.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play Time</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>20-60 minutes</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
